:"2025-07-31T21:12:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T15:37:13Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T15:36:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- *Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/66842.*\n\n### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.beta 2d113cc224cb9be07866d003819fcef2226a52ea\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (2d113cc22) - Fedora Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 575.64.03) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nPer-instance shader parameter values are not correctly exported when the export is performed in `--headless` mode. The default value will be used instead:\n\n### Exported in non-headless mode\n\n*The sphere in the middle has an `emission` per-instance uniform that defaults to green, but we override it to be blue in the inspector.*\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd2bf511-9d85-441e-8e6b-c7fc17334665\" />\n\n### Exported in headless mode\n\n*The sphere uses its default value for the `emission` per-instance uniform, even though we customized it in the inspector previously.*\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6980278-dfc3-4596-97e1-9641f1b1914d\" />\n\nIn comparison, global shader parameters appear work correctly. In the MRP, the sphere is offset by a `position` global uniform and it has the same position in both exports.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Export a project in headless mode (`--export-pack \"Linux\" /path/to/output_headless.zip --headless`).\n- Export a project in non-headless mode (`--export-pack \"Linux\" /path/to/output.zip`).\n- Run both exported projects and compare the appearance (`godot --main-pack /path/to/output.zip`).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21537734/test_project.zip)\n\nExported main packs for comparison:\n \n- [out_linux.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21537717/out_linux.zip)\n- [out_linux_headless.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21537718/out_linux_headless.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109177/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}